@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@password = {{$processEnv TEST_PASSWORD}}

### Registro válido 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Estudiante Demo","email":"demo@example.com","password":"{{password}}"}

### Registro inválido 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"","email":"incorrecto"}

### Email repetido 409: repetir el registro válido anterior

### Login válido 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"demo@example.com","password":"{{password}}"}

### Login inválido 401 (email inexistente)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"inexistente@example.com","password":"{{password}}"}

### Logout 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{}
